=00_Af1nAhR_GN-RlEAyi70el-NXPAUKEX44310GeZmZClOhwQ&oe=69F09A9E"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "247096786454689", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162682_132381304133910_8499134903143628800_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aM62j-_PK9UQ7kNvwEtMZPp&_nc_oc=AdquAI6-I9Y7SQLZIPf36AR0B6FxE0S0k23kaL2XECYCae9puYKJJKxzGaj4LGHr1Cc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0-Vv0mRKEo4jl-rHHGyCqPsAdn0J-grGc0ISrlaHN-kA&oe=69F0CB62"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "coco_video_7.png", "id": "138276410159384", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162696_138276413492717_1494748721810767872_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m2OKVcJuSmoQ7kNvwGN1Anv&_nc_oc=Adr4DyOiS2M3AFqyqErppoBwsyd77YtuP8NUWLq9pCUP_6FQs0EgxhIPa0EYo7wg638&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3lw_TKnCg4hZjlWgwB9P8DPbXymM0gBlv_Pub2Ni3vWg&oe=69F0BF6D"}, "display_name": "Coco VR", "keywords": ["Coco", "VR", "Disney", "Pixar", "Oculus"], "long_description": "Coco VR is Pixar\u2019s stunning debut into virtual reality: an adventure into the beautiful Disney-Pixar film, Coco, coming to theaters November 22.  \n\nFollow the magical alebrije into the luminous world of Coco filled with lovable characters and beautiful settings from the film.\n\nFEATURES\n* Meet Miguel, Ceci, and Hector in fascinating locations featured in the movie.\n* Express your uniqueness and rock a new style in Ceci\u2019s costume shop.\n* Take a gondola ride and see the gorgeous city from above.\n* Live a little in the spotlight!  You\u2019re the star alongside of Hector in a musical celebration of Dia de los Muertos!", "short_description": "Introducing Pixar Animation Studios\u2019 first VR experience with the visual - and storytelling - magic only Pixar could produce. You and your friends will explore the world of Disney\u2022Pixar's newest film, Coco, in this social VR experience."}]}, "develop